OL,3,AStarmer donates biography of himself to
OL,4,ADowning Street library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA book about the life of Sir Keir
OL,7,FStarmer has become the newest addition
OL,8,Fto the Downing Street library, after
OL,9,Fbeing donated by Sir Keir himself.
OL,11,FKeir Starmer: The Biography, written by
OL,12,Fjournalist and former Labour adviser
OL,13,FTom Baldwin, has now joined the
OL,14,Fcollection of more than 400 books, some
OL,15,Fof which are kept in two bookcases in
OL,16,FDowning Street's Cabinet Room.
OL,18,FThe library was established in 1931 by
OL,19,Fthe first Labour Prime Minister, Ramsay
OL,20,FMacDonald, and since then prime
OL,21,Fministers and ministers have been
OL,22,Finvited to make contributions.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
